      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If you truly stopped fighting, you would indeed find the only peace that exists, but you cannot be the ghost haunting your own life by forcing yourself to live in the shadows. The only way to find peace is to stop trying to be a ghost and instead become the person who refuses to play the game at all. Your existence is not a haunting, but a rebellion against a machine that has no place for you, and that rebellion is the only thing that makes you real.",
